e=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'virtual-module'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'export default \"This is virtual!\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (id.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">endsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.special'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { code: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transformSpecial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(code), map: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"插件钩子执行顺序\">插件钩子执行顺序</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 构建阶段 Build Hooks&#10;        OPTIONS[options] --&gt; BUILD_START[buildStart]&#10;        BUILD_START --&gt; RESOLVE[resolveId]&#10;        RESOLVE --&gt; LOAD[load]&#10;        LOAD --&gt; TRANSFORM[transform]&#10;        TRANSFORM --&gt; MODULE_PARSED[moduleParsed]&#10;        MODULE_PARSED --&gt; RESOLVE&#10;        MODULE_PARSED --&gt; BUILD_END[buildEnd]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 输出阶段 Output Hooks&#10;        BUILD_END --&gt; RENDER_START[renderStart]&#10;        RENDER_START --&gt; RENDER_CHUNK[renderChunk]&#10;        RENDER_CHUNK --&gt; GENERATE_BUNDLE[generateBundle]&#10;        GENERATE_BUNDLE --&gt; WRITE_BUNDLE[writeBundle]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 构建阶段 Build Hooks\n        OPTIONS[options] --&gt; BUILD_START[buildStart]\n        BUILD_START --&gt; RESOLVE[resolveId]\n        RESOLVE --&gt; LOAD[load]\n        LOAD --&gt; TRANSFORM[transform]\n        TRANSFORM --&gt; MODULE_PARSED[moduleParsed]\n        MODULE_PARSED --&gt; RESOLVE\n        MODULE_PARSED --&gt; BUILD_END[buildEnd]\n    end\n    subgraph 输出阶段 Output Hooks\n        BUILD_END --&gt; RENDER_START[renderStart]\n        RENDER_START --&gt; RENDER_CHUNK[renderChunk]\n        RENDER_CHUNK --&gt; GENERATE_BUNDLE[generateBundle]\n        GENERATE_BUNDLE --&gt; WRITE_BUNDLE[writeBundle]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"rolldown-rust-驱动的下一代-rollup\">Rolldown：Rust 驱动的下一代 Rollup</h2><p>Rolldown 是 Rollup 的 Rust 重写版本，由 Vite 团队主导开发。它的目标是在保持 Rollup API 完全兼容的同时，将构建性能提升一到两个数量级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么需要-rolldown\">为什么需要 Rolldown？</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 当前 Vite 架构&#10;        DEV1[开发: esbuild 预构建]&#10;        PROD1[生产: Rollup 打包]&#10;        DIFF1[开发/生产行为差异]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 未来 Vite 架构&#10;        ROLLDOWN[Rolldown&lt;br/&gt;统一引擎]&#10;        DEV2[开发: Rolldown]&#10;        PROD2[生产: Rolldown]&#10;        SAME[行为一致]&#10;    end&#10;    DEV1 --&gt; DIFF1&#10;    PROD1 --&gt; DIFF1&#10;    ROLLDOWN --&gt; DEV2&#10;    ROLLDOWN --&gt; PROD2&#10;    DEV2 --&gt; SAME&#10;    PROD2 --&gt; SAME\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 当前 Vite 架构\n        DEV1[开发: esbuild 预构建]\n        PROD1[生产: Rollup 打包]\n        DIFF1[开发/生产行为差异]\n    end\n    subgraph 未来 Vite 架构\n        ROLLDOWN[Rolldown&lt;br/&gt;统一引擎]\n        DEV2[开发: Rolldown]\n        PROD2[生产: Rolldown]\n        SAME[行为一致]\n    end\n    DEV1 --&gt; DIFF1\n    PROD1 --&gt; DIFF1\n    ROLLDOWN --&gt; DEV2\n    ROLLDOWN --&gt; PROD2\n    DEV2 --&gt; SAME\n    PROD2 --&gt; SAME</pre><p>Rolldown 解决了 Vite 当前架构的核心痛点：开发环境使用 esbuild，生产环境使用 Rollup，两者行为不完全一致可能导致开发/生产差异。Rolldown 作为统一引擎，将在两个环境中提供一致的构建行为。</p>\n<h3 id=\"rolldown-的架构\">Rolldown 的架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Rolldown 架构&#10;        PARSER[oxc-parser&lt;br/&gt;Rust AST 解析]&#10;        RESOLVER[oxc-resolver&lt;br/&gt;Rust 模块解析]&#10;        TRANSFORMER[oxc-transformer&lt;br/&gt;Rust 代码转换]&#10;        LINKER[Linker&lt;br/&gt;模块链接]&#10;        CODEGEN[Code Generator&lt;br/&gt;代码生成]&#10;    end&#10;    PARSER --&gt; LINKER&#10;    RESOLVER --&gt; LINKER&#10;    TRANSFORMER --&gt; LINKER&#10;    LINKER --&gt; CODEGEN\">graph TB\n    subgraph Rolldown 架构\n        PARSER[oxc-parser&lt;br/&gt;Rust AST 解析]\n        RESOLVER[oxc-resolver&lt;br/&gt;Rust 模块解析]\n        TRANSFORMER[oxc-transformer&lt;br/&gt;Rust 代码转换]\n        LINKER[Linker&lt;br/&gt;模块链接]\n        CODEGEN[Code Generator&lt;br/&gt;代码生成]\n    end\n    PARSER --&gt; LINKER\n    RESOLVER --&gt; LINKER\n    TRANSFORMER --&gt; LINKER\n    LINKER --&gt; CODEGEN</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>基于</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>oxc-parser</td>\n<td>JavaScript/TypeScript 解析器</td>\n<td>Oxc 项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oxc-resolver</td>\n<td>模块路径解析器</td>\n<td>enhanced-resolve</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oxc-transformer</td>\n<td>代码转换器</td>\n<td>Oxc 项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linker</td>\n<td>模块链接与 Scope Hoisting</td>\n<td>Rolldown 原创</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"使用-rolldown\">使用 Rolldown</h3><p>Rolldown 的配置格式与 Rollup 高度兼容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// rolldown.config.js&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;rolldown&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  input: &#39;src/index.ts&#39;,&#10;  output: {&#10;    dir: &#39;dist&#39;,&#10;    format: &#39;esm&#39;,&#10;    sourcemap: true,&#10;  },&#10;  resolve: {&#10;    alias: {&#10;      &#39;@&#39;: &#39;./src&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// rolldown.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rolldown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  output: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sourcemap: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolve: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alias: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"性能对比\">性能对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>Rollup</th>\n<th>Rolldown</th>\n<th>提升倍数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冷构建（中型项目）</td>\n<td>~8s</td>\n<td>~0.8s</td>\n<td>~10x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热构建（有缓存）</td>\n<td>~3s</td>\n<td>~0.3s</td>\n<td>~10x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>~500MB</td>\n<td>~200MB</td>\n<td>~2.5x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行处理</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>充分利用多核</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rollup-vs-rolldown-选型指南\">Rollup vs Rolldown 选型指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START{选择打包工具}&#10;    START --&gt;|库打包,追求稳定| ROLLUP[Rollup]&#10;    START --&gt;|库打包,追求性能| ROLLDOWN[Rolldown]&#10;    START --&gt;|应用打包| VITE[Vite&lt;br/&gt;内置 Rollup/Rolldown]&#10;    START --&gt;|需要 Webpack 生态| RSPACK[Rspack]\">flowchart TD\n    START{选择打包工具}\n    START --&gt;|库打包,追求稳定| ROLLUP[Rollup]\n    START --&gt;|库打包,追求性能| ROLLDOWN[Rolldown]\n    START --&gt;|应用打包| VITE[Vite&lt;br/&gt;内置 Rollup/Rolldown]\n    START --&gt;|需要 Webpack 生态| RSPACK[Rspack]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Rollup 是 ESM 优先的库打包器，以 Tree-shaking 和 Scope Hoisting 著称。</li>\n<li>Rollup 的输出代码干净高效，没有多余的运行时包裹。</li>\n<li>Rollup 的插件系统是 Vite 插件系统的基础。</li>\n<li>Rolldown 是 Rollup 的 Rust 重写版本，性能提升约 10 倍。</li>\n<li>Rolldown 将成为 Vite 的统一构建引擎，解决开发/生产行为不一致的问题。</li>\n<li>对于库开发，Rollup/Rolldown 是比 Webpack 更优的选择。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Rollup 与 Rolldown","id":"rollup-与-rolldown"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Rollup：ESM 优先的库打包器","id":"rollup-esm-优先的库打包器"},{"level":3,"text":"Rollup 的核心优势","id":"rollup-的核心优势"},{"level":3,"text":"基本配置","id":"基本配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Scope Hoisting","id":"scope-hoisting"},{"level":3,"text":"插件系统","id":"插件系统"},{"level":3,"text":"插件钩子执行顺序","id":"插件钩子执行顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"Rolldown：Rust 驱动的下一代 Rollup","id":"rolldown-rust-驱动的下一代-rollup"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要 Rolldown？","id":"为什么需要-rolldown"},{"level":3,"text":"Rolldown 的架构","id":"rolldown-的架构"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 Rolldown","id":"使用-rolldown"},{"level":3,"text":"性能对比","id":"性能对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Rollup vs Rolldown 选型指南","id":"rollup-vs-rolldown-选型指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Vite 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/vite-architecture"},"next":{"title":"esbuild 极速构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/esbuild"}}